            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <th scope="row">Sticky keys</th>
                <td>Dust, dirt, or lack of lubrication</td>
                <td>Clean keys with a brush and compressed air. Apply a small amount of oil to the key mechanism.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <th scope="row">Faded text</th>
                <td>Old or worn ribbon</td>
                <td>Replace the ribbon and confirm the new ribbon is compatible with your model.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <th scope="row">Paper jams</th>
                <td>Misaligned rollers or too many sheets</td>
                <td>Realign rollers and insert one or two sheets. Clean rollers regularly.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <th scope="row">Uneven typing</th>
                <td>Misaligned typebars or uneven platen</td>
                <td>Adjust typebars carefully or have the platen inspected by a professional. Use consistent typing pressure.</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </section>

